From be164a9ed9d8e05857e9e658348b0033f96fc0f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stephen Harris <swharris82@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 17:51:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add a custom-test network for private chains with
 Testnet addresses

Add `-n custom-test`, which uses Testnet address encodings with the
activation heights from `--activation-heights`, persisted like regtest.
This lets the wallet run against a configured Zebra Testnet such as the
Lacuna network.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PMN6sd47rYSvftBgYpdS2G
---
